{
  "type": "record",
  "name": "ElementBytes",
  "namespace": "avro2s.benchmarks.models",
  "doc": "One logical type per record, held in a collection, so the measurement is dominated by the per-element cost of converting it rather than by anything else in the record. control: bytes with no logical type, the baseline for decimal",
